		interrupt-driven single-channel sampler intended for
		resistor-ladder keypad scanning.  Registers as /dev/lradc0
		and delivers raw 6-bit codes (0..63) through the standard
		NuttX ADC upper half.  On the t113-evb board the LRADC pin
		is wired to a 5-button voltage-ladder keypad; a board-level
		keypad driver consumes these samples via the ADC callback.

